    "title": "Kwame Raoul: Would not embrace utilizing National Guard for policing - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Pete Zimmerman ,\n6 hours ago Illinois Attorney General Kwame Raoul joins John Williams to talk about President Trump saying he wants to send the National Guard to Chicago to combat violence. AG Raoul explains what conditions would need to be met for the National Guard to be deployed to the city, the benefits of ongoing collaboration with federal law enforcement, what might happen if the National Guard did come to Illinois, and why he’s not opposed to help from the federal government to fight crime. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
